OL,3,GNEWSATeen arrested after man injured in
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman was stabbed in Bestwood.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,10,Fservices were called to Beckhampton
OL,11,FRoad at about 14:15 GMT on Monday.
OL,13,FA man in his 20s was found injured and
OL,14,F"is being treated in hospital for
OL,15,Fabdominal wounds", the force said,
OL,16,Fadding his injuries "are not believed
OL,17,Fto be life-threatening of life-altering
OL,18,Fin nature".
